s  not a lot of new information but we're  getting close one way or the other since  that rumor about the final season being  short is going around it's nice that  we'll probably learn for sure early next  month as mentioned last year they put  out the release schedule though i don't  remember seeing the episode run times  until later i don't think those showed  up until much closer to the premiere i  said i was gonna make it short and i'm  gonna stick to that let me know in the  comments what you think about this first  look image and what you're hoping to  find out at the comic-con panel please  like this video if you enjoyed it please  subscribe to my channel if you haven't  already thanks for watching i'll talk to  you soon
 

